iple answer item where allocated marks are for each blank within the fraction\",\r\n    common_richtext_insert_fraction_label_6: \"Please click on image below to update\",\r\n    common_label_type: \"Type\",\r\n    common_channel_type0: \"Content Package\",\r\n    common_channel_type1: \"Vanilla eBook\",\r\n\tcommon_channel_type2: \"Enhanced eBook\",\r\n    common_channel_type3: \"Assessment\",\r\n    common_channel_type4: \"Flipbook\",\r\n    common_channel_type5: \"Student Books\",\r\n    common_channel_type6: \"Workbooks\",\r\n    common_channel_type7: \"Teacher’s Resources\",\r\n    common_channel_type8: \"Personalised Learning\",\n    common_channel_type9: \"Sample\",\r\n    common_channel_type10: \"Digital Literacy\",\r\n    common_channel_type77: \"Home Instructor's Resources\",\r\n    common_channel_typenew: \"What's New\",\r\n    /*===============NEW 05.11.2020============*/\r\n    common_resource_sharing: \"Resource Sharing\",\r\n    /*===============NEW 09.21.2020============*/\r\n    common_question_analysis: \"Question Analysis\",\r\n    common_label_mark: \"Mark\",\r\n    common_label_mark_test: \"Mark Test\",\r\n    common_label_released: \"Released\",\r\n    common_label_release_result: \"Release Result\",\r\n    common_label_selected_all_teacher: \"All Teachers\",\r\n    common_label_selected_none: \"None\",\r\n    common_label_share_with_others_multiple: \"Share with others ({{item_count}} items)\",\r\n    common_ebook_review: \"e-Workbook\",\r\n    common_no_ebook_found: \"There are no ebooks that match your selection.\",\r\n    common_oral_buddy: \"Oral Buddy\",\r\n    common_no_oralbudding_found: \"There are no oral buddy recording found for the selected student.\",\r\n    common_label_role: \"Role\",\r\n    common_label_teacher: \"Teacher\",\r\n    /*===============NEW 2021 ============*/\r\n    common_track_subjects: \"Track Subjects\",\r\n    common_add_library_content:\"Add Library Content\",\r\n    common_link_my_accounts: \"Link My Accounts\",\r\n    common_create_account: \"Create Retail Account\",\r\n    common_access_code_linked: \"Access code verification successful! <br /><br />Your new content is now available. Please refresh your page if you still do not see the new content.\",\r\n    common_access_code_links: \"You have already redeemed the access code. <br /><br /> Please refresh your page if you still do not see the new content.\",\r\n    common_access_code_linkr: \"You have already redeemed the access code. <br /><br /> Please refresh your page if you still do not see the new content.\",\r\n    common_access_code_activate_fail1: \"You have entered an access code for duplicate content\",\r\n    common_access_code_sch_expired: \"The subscription for your school has already expired.<br/><br/>If you would like to continue accessing our resources, you may contact your School Administrator, or email us directly at <a href='mailto:marketing@mceducation.com'>marketing@mceducation.com</a>.\",\r\n    common_access_link_retail: \"Link My Existing Retail Account\",\r\n    common_access_create_retail: \"Create a New Retail Account\",\r\n    common_retail_link_fail90: \"Error occured when processing your request.\",\r\n    common_retail_link_fail0: \"Error - Invalid user.\",\r\n    common_retail_link_fail1: \"Error - You cannot link 2 school accounts.\",\r\n    common_retail_link_fail2: \"Error - Retail account is already linked to another account.\",\r\n    common_retail_link_fail99: \"Retail account is already linked.\",\r\n    common_retail_link_fail9: \"Error - Unable to link retail account.\",\r\n    common_retail_link_fail91: \"Error - You have entered an access code for duplicate content\",\r\n    common_link_retail_success: \"Success - Retail account linked successfully.\",\r\n    common_register_access_code_quota_full: \"Access code is fully redeemed\",\r\n    common_register_access_code_denied: \"Invalid access code. If you have purchased a 2nd hand book, contact: <a href=\\\"mailto:helpdesk@mceducation.com\\\" target=\\\"_top\\\">helpdesk@mceducation.com</a>.\",\r\n    common_register_profanity_user_id: \"Error - Profanities detected in the User ID.\",\r\n    common_invalid_credential: \"Error - Fields cannot be empty.\",\r\n    common_confirmation_close_prompt_save_site: \"Closing content player?\\n\\nChanges you made may not be saved.\",\r\n    common_label_raw_score: \"Raw Score\",\r\n    common_label_max_score: \"Max Score\",\r\n    common_close_content_player: \"Close Content Player\",\r\n    common_back_content_player: \"Back\",\r\n    common_access_control: \"Access Control\",\r\n    common_manage_access_code:\"Manage Access Code\",\r\n    common_access_code_activate_fail3: \"<p>This access code contains access to Teacher Resources in the Resource Bank that are currently not available in your existing account setup.</p><p>After you click Proceed to Activate, please allow 3 days for our system to copy the Teacher Resources and confiigure the access rights to your account.</p>\",\r\n    common_btn_proceed_activate: \"Proceed to Activate\",\r\n    common_access_code_activate_fail2: \"Access code is fully redeemed\",\r\n    common_modal_block_title:\"This content can't be shown\",\r\n    common_modal_block_message: \"We tried opening this content in MCEduhub, but it does not work. You can try to open this in a new window.\",\r\n    common_btn_open_new_win: \"Open in new window\",\r\n    common_access_code_grade: \"<br/><br/>Please note that you are now in {{grade_name}}.\",\r\n    common_new_password: \"New Password\",\n    common_confirm_password: \"Confirm Password\",\r\n    common_password_rules_msg: \"Password must be made up of a minimum of 8 alphanumeric characters, containing at least 1  letter and 1 numeral. It  can only contain character a-z, number 0-9 and symbol _ - . @.\",\n    common_new_confirm_password_not_match: \"New password and confirm password do not match.\",\n    common_submit_school_code_denied: \"Invalid school code.\",\r\n    common_join_school_success: \"<div class=\\\"text-center\\\"><h1 class=\\\"text-success display-3\\\"><i class=\\\"fas fa-check-circle\\\"></i></h1><p><b>You have successfully joined <b>{{sch_fullname}}</b>.<br/><br/>Your new login credentials<br/>User ID: {{user_name}}<br/>School: {{sch_name}}<br/><br/> Click \\\"OK\\\" to logout and proceed to login with your new credentials.</p></div>\",\r\n    common_migrate_agree_text: \"<b>You have requested to join: {{sch_fullname}}</b><br/><br/><span style=\\\"font-weight:bold;color:RED;\\\">This action cannot be undone.</span><br/><br/>This action will:<ul><li><span style=\\\"font-weight:bold;color:RED;\\\">Permanently erase</span> records of all shared items and assignments from your current school, if any.</li><li><span style=\\\"font-weight:bold;color:RED;\\\">Permanently delete</span> all files uploaded in My Resources, if any</li></ul>You may wish to download all necessary files before you proceed.\",\r\n    common_modal_enter_accesscode: \"<i class=\\\"fas fa-key\\\"></i> Enter Access Code\",\r\n    common_modal_enter_schoolcode: \"<i class=\\\"fas fa-key\\\"></i> Enter School Code\",\r\n    common_join_school_fail_0: \"Error occured when processing your request.\",\r\n    common_join_school_fail_1:\"You must have teacher or student role to join another school.\",\r\n    common_join_school_fail_2:\"Invalid user.\",\r\n    common_join_school_fail_3:\"Invalid school code.\",\r\n    common_join_school_fail_4: \"School code is fully redeemed.\",\r\n    common_join_school_fail_5: \"You have entered a school code of your current school.<br/><br/>If you are a student who needs your account to be moved to a different class, please inform your teacher.\",\r\n    common_join_school_fail_6: \"You have entered a school code that does not have a form class.\",\r\n    common_join_school_fail_7: \"Error: This user id already exists in new school. <br/><br/>Please contact <a href=\\\"mailto:helpdesk@mceducation.com\\\">helpdesk@mceducation.com</a> for assistance.\",\r\n    common_manage_subscription: \"Manage Subscription\",\r\n    common_btn_request_renew:\"Submit Request for Renewal\",\r\n    common_label_content_title: \"Content Title\",\r\n    common_launch_pd_portal: \"Launch PD Portal\",\r\n    common_launch_pd_no_email: \"You need to have an email address in your user profile to launch PD Portal.\",\r\n    common_launch_pd_email_not_registered: \"Your email address is not registered on PD Portal. Please inform your school leader for access.\",\n\n    common_label_enter_acccess_code: \"Enter Access Code\",\n    common_label_invalid_acccess_code: \"Invalid access code\",\n    common_label_access_code_validation_success: \"Access Code Validation Success\",\n    common_label_redirect_self_reg_page: \"Redirecting to self-registration page...\",\n    common_text_req_submit_success: \"Request submitted successfully.\",\n    common_text_req_submit_failed: \"Failed to submit request. Please try again later.\",\n    common_text_refresh_browser: \"Please refresh your browser and try again.\",\n    common_btn_clear_all: \"Clear All\",\r\n\r\n    common_message_redeemed: \"Access Code Redeemed\",\r\n    common_access_code_activate_fail4: \"<p align='left'>This access code cannot be activated within your SLS-linked account.</p><p align='left'>Please proceed to mceduhub.com and login to your existing account directly to activate this access code.</p>\",\r\n    common_access_code_activate_fail5: \"<p align='left'>This access code must be activated within your MOE Singapore's<br/>SLS-linked account.</p><p align='left'>Please login to your SLS account and proceed to the SLS App Library. Launch the MCEduhub App, click on your avatar and select “+Add Library Content” to activate the access code.</p><p align='left'><span class='d-flex'>View the online user guide &nbsp;<a style='color:red' href='/\\Lead/\\public/\\localization/\\support/\\en-GB/\\MCE MOE SLS ADF Integration User Guide.pdf' target='_blank'><i class='fa-solid fa-file-pdf fa-xl'></i></a></span></p><p align='left'>If you do not have an SLS account, please contact <a href=\\'mailto:helpdesk@mceducation.com\\'>helpdesk@mceducation.com</a> for assistance.</p>\",\r\n\n    common_message_profile_access_code_activate_user_fail1: \"<p align='left'>The user has registered the different access code with same channel.</p>\",\n    common_message_profile_access_code_activate_user_fail2: \"<p align='left'>This user has exceeded quota.</p>\",\n    common_message_profile_access_code_activate_user_fail3: \"<div style='padding:0.5rem 2rem; text-align:left'><p>This access code contains access to Teacher Resources in the Resource Bank that do not exist in your current school login.</p><p>If you proceed, you will not gain access to these Teacher Resources, and you may then inform our Helpdesk to manually open them up for you in your current school login.</p><p>Alternatively, you may cancel and logout, then activate this access code by self-registering a new separate account.</p></div>\",\n    common_message_profile_access_code_activate_user_fail4: \"<p align='left'>This access code is only for Teachers.</p> <p align='left'>If you need further assistance, pls contact <a href=\\'mailto:helpdesk@mceducation.com\\'>helpdesk@mceducation.com</a></p>.\",\n\n    common_label_accesscode_success_valid: \"Success! Access Code is valid.\",\n    common_label_accesscode_error_invalid: \"ERROR! Access Code is NOT valid.\",\r\n    common_label_accesscode_note_second_handbook: \"*If you have purchased a 2nd hand book, contact: <a href=\\\"mailto:helpdesk@mceducation.com\\\" target=\\\"_top\\\">helpdesk@mceducation.com</a>.\",\r\n    common_btn_add_another: \"+ Add Another\",\r\n    common_btn_validate: \"Validate\",\n    common_btn_clear: \"Clear\",\r\n    common_btn_remove: \"Remove\",\r\n    common_label_new_user: \"New User\",\r\n    common_label_existing_user: \"Existing User\",\n    common_label_ac_expiring: \"Expiring\",\n    common_label_ac_expired: \"Expired\",\r\n\r\n    common_modal_contact_helpdesk: \"Contact Helpdesk\",\r\n    common_modal_contact_helpdesk_msg: \"To access the Professional Development Portal, your email address needs to be synced. Contact us for assistance at <u>helpdesk@mceducation.com</u> or report an issue.\",\r\n    common_btn_report_issue: \"Report An Issue\",\r\n\r\n    common_btn_downloadapp: \"Download App\",\r\n    common_btn_downloadapp_notiftext_desktop: \"Get MCEduhub App to access your eBooks <u>offline</u>&nbsp;\",\r\n    common_btn_downloadapp_notiftext_mobile: \"Get MCEduhub App\",\r\n    common_modal_dlapp_download_mce: \"Download MCEduhub App\",\r\n    common_modal_dlapp_access_anytime: \"Access your MCE ebooks anywhere, anytime!\",\r\n    common_modal_dlapp_user_guide: \"User Guide\",\r\n    common_modal_dlapp_datafetch_data: \"Failed to fetch data. Please try again later.\",\r\n\r\n    common_modal_ext_link_title: \"External Link Notice\",\n    common_modal_ext_link_text: \"You are continuing to another website that Marshall Cavendish Education does not own or operate. Its owner is solely responsible for the website's content and security. Please refer to the website's Privacy Policy and Terms of Use.\",\r\n\r\n    common_privacy_terms_agree: \"I agree with\",\n    common_privacy_terms_data_prot: \"Data Protection\",\n    common_privacy_terms_priv_state: \"Privacy Statement\",\n    common_privacy_terms_and: \"and\",\n    common_privacy_terms_terms: \"Terms\",\n    common_privacy_terms_conditions: \"Conditions\",\r\n    common_privacy_terms_consent_note: \"<br/><strong>Note:</strong> To give you the best possible experience on our website, your data may be <br/> passed on to our partner and subjected to their privacy policy and terms of use.\",\r\n    common_btn_proceed: \"Proceed\",\r\n    common_modal_warning_withdraw_consent: \"<p><strong style='color:red'>WARNING!</strong> Withdrawing your consent for this option will cause your account to be <strong>deactivated</strong> and flagged for future deletion!</p>\",\r\n    common_btn_continue: \"Continue\",\r\n    common_modal_welcome_to_mceduhub: \"Welcome to MCEduHub!\",\r\n    common_modal_note_consent_first_login_a: \"<p>By clicking <span style='font-style:italic; font-weight:700'>Continue</span>, I agree to Marshall Cavendish Education <a href='/\\Lead/\\Login/\\Privacy.aspx' target='_blank'><strong><u>Privacy Policy</u></strong></a> and <a href='/\\Lead/\\Login/\\Terms.aspx' target='_blank'><strong><u>Terms of Use</u></strong></a>.</p>\",\r\n    common_modal_note_consent_first_login_b: \"<p>To give you the best possible experience on our website, your data may be passed on to our partner and subjected to their privacy policy and terms of use.</p>\",\r\n\r\n    common_email_address: \"Email Address\",\r\n    common_email_verify0: \"Unverified\",\r\n    common_email_verify1: \"Verified\",\r\n    common_btn_verify_email: \"Verify Email\",\r\n    common_btn_resend: \"Resend\",\r\n    common_btn_submit: \"Submit\",\r\n    common_lbl_enter_email_ver_pin: \"Email Verification\",\r\n    common_lbl_enter_6digitpin: \"Enter 6-digit PIN code\",\r\n    common_lbl_ver_pin_success_sent: \"Successfully sent a new verification PIN code.\",\r\n    common_lbl_err_enter_ver_pin: \"Input verification PIN code!\",\r\n    common_lbl_sent_6_digit_email: \"We sent a 6-digit PIN code to your email address. <br/>\",\r\n    common_lbl_didnt_receive_eamil: \"Didn't receive the PIN code? Resend button will be enabled in\",\r\n    common_modal_contact_helpdesk_msg_sch_no_users: \"School has no users found. Please contact Helpdesk for an assistant.\",\n    common_modal_contact_helpdesk_msg_multiple_schs_found: \"Multiple target schools found. Please contact Helpdesk for an assistant.\",\n    common_modal_contact_helpdesk_msg_email_notfound_in_sch: \"We could not find your email in the target school. Please contact Helpdesk for an assistant.\",\n    common_modal_contact_helpdesk_msg_user_exists: \"Failed to register account. Please use different email as user login id.\",\n\n    common_modal_email_verify_required: \"Email Verification Required\",\n    common_modal_email_verify_required_note: \"Please verify your email address to ensure you receive important notifications and keep your account secured.\",\n    common_modal_btn_later: \"Later\",\n    common_modal_btn_verify_email: \"Verify Email\",\n    common_modal_btn_send: \"Send\",\n    common_modal_trouble_email_access_taphere: \"Having trouble accessing this email? Tap here!\",\n    common_modal_input_valid_eadd: \"Input a valid email address for this account.\",\n    common_modal_invalid_emailaddress: \"Invalid email address\",\n    common_modal_req_working_emailaddress: \"Required a working email address.\",\n    common_modal_error_email_failed: \"Email Verification PIN code failed to send. Please try again later.\",\n    common_modal_error_pin_expired: \"PIN code provided has expired. Please resend a new PIN code.\",\n    common_modal_error_pin_incorrect: \"Incorrect PIN code provided. Please try again.\",\n    common_modal_error_system_error: \"Our system is temporary unable to process your request. Please contact support or helpdesk.\",\n    common_modal_success_email_verification: \"Email successfully verified.\",\r\n    common_modal_contact_helpdesk_msg_email_exists: \"Email already exists in the system. Please contact Helpdesk for an assistant.\",\n\n    common_modal_mfa_title_sendotp: \"Sending One-Time PIN (OTP) code\",\n    common_modal_mfa_user_message: \"As part of our ongoing commitment to enhancing security, we've implemented <span style='font-weight:600'>Two-Factor Authentication (2FA)</span> for all logins. This provides an extra layer of protection for your account.\",\n    common_modal_mfa_provide_email: \"Provide an email address below.\",\n    common_modal_mfa_input_valid_email: \"Please enter a valid and working email address to continue.\",\r\n};"
