            "text": "{\"postdate\":\"2026-05-11\",\"name\":\"eLearning Portal Administrator\",\"title\":\"Scheduled maintenance from 17 May 2026, 9:30pm to 18 May 2026, 3:00am (SGT)\",\"type\":\"0\",\"had_ack\":\"0\",\"msg\":\"<p>We will be conducting a scheduled maintenance from 17 May 2026, 9:30pm to 18 May 2026, 3:00am (SGT).</p>\\n<p>During this period, the eLearning portal will not be accessible. We apologise for any inconvenience caused.</p>\",\"schid\":\"3DBD6995-9A4F-4136-B6FB-4EB35AEB6AB0\",\"userid\":\"C0B03998-A787-45D7-9839-5F661B535760\"}"
